    "missing-key and explicit-empty semantics remain distinct",
    "heterogeneous ID types, opaque metadata/provenance, and array ordering are preserved exactly",
    "A3 semantic edge/provenance counts remain distinct from duplicated transport serialization counts",
    "consumer output deep structural parity and canonical digest parity both pass against an independently generated full oracle",
